description	"Qui-Gon Jinn -Marshall

An offense-oriented Jedi, characterized by powerful Lightsaber swings and solid Force abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Deflect (1)
-- 125% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more Dmg

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Sense (2)
- Speed (2) ^3[CS3]
- Mindtrick (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)"
